[{"id":3479101680,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7PXuDw","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"0ae57c5d61280dfecffc24f1ae2759a2deeaf9ad","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally (including `make_rst.py`), it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nextends Node2D\r\n\r\n## This is a test comment.[br]\r\n## [note]This is a [code]note[/code].[/note][br]\r\n## [warning]This is a [code]warning[/code].[/warning][br]\r\n## [tip]This is a [code]tip[/code].[/tip][br]\r\n## [important]This is [code]important[/code].[/important][br]\r\n## More text following admonitions.\r\nvar test = 1\r\n\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\tprint(test)\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Modern theme\r\n\r\nDefault | Light\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8bf3798c-2679-4555-bd11-58fea3d1d389\" /> | <img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9c38f753-e002-4f0c-bbab-915ead7eddec\" />\r\n\r\n### Classic theme\r\n\r\nDefault | Light\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2ff1e9d2-0a99-43c1-b167-71f95b99bd83\" /> | <img width=\"343\" height=\"172\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5329e329-4d27-41c4-89da-3fbaea577f8f\" />\r\n\r\n### `make_rst.py` output in godot-docs\r\n\r\n*Use `--doctool --gdscript-docs /path/to/project`, then `doc/tools/make_rst.py /path/to/project/docs/class_node_2d.gd.xml` and copy `class_node_2d.gd.rst` to the `classes` folder of godot-docs.*\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<img width=\"833\" height=\"1286\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3f6df30f-cd1b-4738-b657-d6e768635440\" />\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nPS: `important` admonitions appear green in both dark and light theme in the generated Sphinx documentation, I'm not sure why. They were normally either yellow or orange as I recall.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#pullrequestreview-3479101680","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111375","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-18T18:02:59Z"},{"id":4372441593,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBJ4p-Q","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"d15d10dce84f05f00a7f8eb3620e96c1cc5bd2a8","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111375#pullrequestreview-4372441593","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111375","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-05-27T12:50:50Z"},{"id":4863656128,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIeWAwA","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"140f16fdee3003b73173a2f345e8a94fac6c7bb9","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?u=8069d9b7bc6ab503ce83dfcfa53fd021672aeccf&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","id":6672771